			"imageAlt": "排版图型 SC-014 留白驱动主视觉信息卡",
			"prompt": "小红书社媒卡。整体保留大面积留白。顶部设置 1–2 行醒目的短标题，与主体区域形成清晰层级；中下部设置一个占据主要面积的大型主视觉，主视觉可居中、偏左或偏右，不固定位置，并通过主体自身的轮廓、姿态和占位关系自然形成若干留白区域。将 4–6 个尺寸较小的信息单元穿插在这些留白区域中，每个单元由一个小视觉元素与极短文字组成，位置服从主视觉留下的空间，不平均环绕主体，不形成规则左右分栏。小信息单元应明显小于主视觉并贴合主体轮廓的空隙，可上下错落、疏密变化，不能使用统一卡片框、规则宫格、表格或明显分割线。底部可保留一句很短的总结文字作为收尾。整体强调主视觉优先、留白驱动、信息穿插，画面完整而非模块拼接。\n\nXiaohongshu social-media card with generous negative space. Place a prominent one- or two-line short headline at the top, clearly separated from the main subject area. In the middle and lower area, place one large primary visual occupying most of the composition; it may be centered, left-weighted, or right-weighted rather than locked to one position. Let the primary visual's silhouette, pose, and spatial footprint naturally create several areas of open space. Insert 4–6 smaller information units into those open spaces, each made of a small visual element and extremely short text. Let their positions follow the space left by the primary visual rather than preset columns; do not distribute them evenly around the subject or create regular side-by-side columns. Keep the small units clearly smaller than the primary visual and close to the gaps created by its outline, with varied vertical positions and density. Do not use uniform card frames, regular grids, tables, or obvious divider lines. A very short summary sentence may appear at the bottom as a closing element. Prioritize the main visual, let whitespace drive the placement, and weave information into the composition so it reads as one complete scene rather than assembled modules.",
