			"prompt": "小红书社媒卡。排版：设置一个主标题，标签文字以自由、自然的方式分布在画面中，对画面里的角色、物件或场景元素做出简短注解，让文字参与整体构图。保留大面积留白，角色高度概括，减少装饰和复杂分区，保持构图简洁。\n\nXiaohongshu social-media card. Layout: include a main headline, then distribute label text freely and naturally across the composition to provide brief annotations for the characters, objects, or scene elements. Let the text participate in the overall composition. Preserve generous negative space, use highly simplified characters, minimize decoration and complex sections, and keep the composition clean.",
