			"title": "SC-019 中央人物细线标注卡",
			"image": "/images/layouts/social-cards/SC-019.webp",
			"imageAlt": "排版图型 SC-019 中央人物细线标注卡",
			"prompt": "小红书社媒卡。排版采用“顶部标题＋中央大人物＋左右零散标签”的三级结构。画面顶部放置一句醒目的短标题，字号最大，居中或略偏左。画面中央放置一个完整人物作为绝对视觉主体，人物占画面高度约 60%–75%，从中上部延伸到底部，保持完整轮廓。人物左右两侧分散安排 3–5 个极短标签，每个标签仅一行或短词组，并用简短细线、斜线或引导线指向人物附近对应位置。标签上下错落、自由分布，左右保持视觉平衡，不做成规则列表。人物与文字之间保留充足间距，不遮挡人物主体。背景大面积留白，不增加复杂图块、卡片框、表格或多余装饰，确保手机端一眼可读。\n\nXiaohongshu social-media card. Use a clear three-level structure of “top headline + large central person + scattered labels on both sides.” Place one prominent short headline at the top in the largest type, centered or slightly left-aligned. Put one complete person in the center as the absolute visual focus; the person should occupy about 60%–75% of the image height, extend from the upper-middle area toward the bottom, and retain a complete silhouette. Distribute 3–5 extremely short labels on both sides, each limited to one line or a short phrase, with brief thin lines, slashes, or leader lines pointing toward nearby parts of the person. Stagger and distribute the labels freely rather than as a regular list, while keeping left-right balance. Leave generous space between the person and text without covering the subject. Preserve a largely empty background and avoid complex graphic blocks, card frames, tables, or extra decoration for immediate mobile readability.",
