			"imageAlt": "排版图型 IG-003 多行左文右图信息图",
			"prompt": "小红书信息图。高泛用性多层/多行图文并列结构。排版：顶部设置醒目的主标题区（可包含主标题、副标题、日期/标签或分类标语）；主体由多行（通常 3–5 层）垂直等距对齐的横向模块组成，每一行采用左侧文字信息（时间点/小标题/标签与要点说明）、右侧对应配图（场景插图/实物/产品图）的并列结构，各行保持整齐统一的水平对齐；底部可配置总结提示、实用贴士备忘或简短结语。该版式通用于各类横向分层条目展示，包括但不限于每日行程路线安排、图鉴速览、分类清单、步骤流程、多维度对照或对比等场景。\n\nXiaohongshu infographic. Highly versatile multi-row text-and-image structure. Layout: place a prominent headline area at the top (can include main title, subtitle, date/tag, or category slogan). The main body consists of multiple vertically stacked, uniformly spaced item rows (typically 3–5 tiers). Each row uses a consistent side-by-side structure with text information on the left (timestamp, subhead, tags, descriptive bullets) and the corresponding illustration or photo on the right, maintaining neat horizontal alignment across all rows. The bottom section can include summary notes, practical tips, or a brief closing remark. This layout is broadly versatile, seamlessly supporting daily travel itineraries, timeline routes, catalog overviews, curated lists, step-by-step processes, as well as multi-item comparisons.",
