			"prompt": "小红书信息图。排版：百科全书式信息卡。采用“顶部主标本展示区 + 中部非对称多模块信息区 + 底部资料来源区”的三段式结构。顶部以主视觉实物/标本为核心，搭配标题、学名/副标题、分类标签与少量基础信息。中部通过细线网格、坐标系统和黄金分割组织6–10个信息模块，混合小标题、短文、图解、对比、数据条、地图、时间轴等形式，整体图文混排、秩序清晰、留白充足。底部设置弱化的编号、注释或来源说明区，整体呈现标本馆档案与现代博物馆导览牌融合的理性设计感。\n\nXiaohongshu infographic. Layout: Encyclopedic information card. Structured in three tiers: \"top primary specimen display zone + middle asymmetrical multi-module information zone + bottom source reference zone\". The top is centered around a primary visual object/specimen, accompanied by the main title, scientific name/subtitle, classification tags, and concise foundational details. The middle section organizes 6–10 information modules through hairline grids, coordinate systems, and golden-ratio compositions, integrating subheadings, short paragraphs, diagrams, comparative charts, data bars, maps, and timelines into a well-ordered, generous typographic balance. The bottom contains an understated numbering, footnote, or reference citation area, presenting a rational design aesthetic combining herbarium archival sheets with contemporary museum exhibition boards.",
