			"prompt": "小红书信息图。排版：讲义式高密分析信息图。一页高信息密度的讲义式分析排版，整体呈现“先总览、再分解、再总结”的清晰结构。顶部设置主标题栏与核心要点/速览区；中部为主体分析区，由多个带编号的独立分析卡片模块组成，各模块包含要点小标题、项目符号清单、公式框与局部图解说明，并穿插表格容器、步骤流程区与思维导图/流程连接区，通过不同大小的内容区形成丰富的视觉节奏；底部设置通栏重点结论区与易错提醒/避坑说明区，辅以边缘补充说明区与角落批注小框。版面遵循从上到下、从左到右的严谨阅读顺序，分区明确、容器边框分明，不做海报式单一视觉中心布局，不做机械均分网格，不添加知识点以外的纯装饰性图像元素。\n\nXiaohongshu infographic. Layout: High-density handout analytical infographic. A single-page, high-density structured study handout layout following a clear \"overview, breakdown, and summary\" visual hierarchy. The top features a prominent main header bar paired with a core key takeaways/overview panel. The middle section serves as the core analytical body, composed of multiple sequentially numbered modular cards featuring subheadings, bullet points, formula containers, and localized diagrammatic explanations, flexibly interspersed with structured table containers, step-by-step procedure sequences, and flowchart/decision-tree connection zones to create an engaging visual rhythm across varied block sizes. The bottom anchors the page with full-width key conclusion and warning/error-alert callout sections, complemented by marginal annotations and compact corner callout boxes. The layout follows a strict top-to-bottom, left-to-right reading order with distinct container boundaries and structured card frames; avoids single-focal-point poster composition, avoids rigid equal grids, and strictly excludes decorative imagery outside essential informational diagrams.",
